WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.373
Five AI tools.

2
00:00:02.323 --> 00:00:05.589
Five logins. Five bills.

3
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.330
And none of them talk to each other.

4
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.309
So I built one that does all of it.

5
00:00:11.409 --> 00:00:13.759
Meet Sibyl.

6
00:00:14.659 --> 00:00:16.539
Ask in plain words.

7
00:00:16.539 --> 00:00:18.280
It figures out the rest.

8
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.006
Not walls of text. Real answers.

9
00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:28.251
Charts, tables, forms. And you can just talk to it.

10
00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:31.111
Give an agent its own computer.

11
00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:35.330
It does the clicking. You approve anything that matters.

12
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:39.547
A whole slide deck, for two cents.

13
00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.861
An image, for four.

14
00:00:42.561 --> 00:00:45.343
And meetings that take their own notes.

15
00:00:46.243 --> 00:00:49.296
Connected to the tools you already use.

16
00:00:50.297 --> 00:00:54.728
Open source. On your own server. With your own key.

17
00:00:54.877 --> 00:00:58.872
Sibyl. Pay for the thinking, not the seat.
